---
description: Monetary repository rules (git conventions, architecture, verification)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` (rules for AI agents) and `CONTRIBUTING.md` (conventions) at the repository root. They are
mandatory: branch names `<type>/<kebab-case>`, Conventional Commit messages and PR titles, a filled-in PR
description from `.github/pull_request_template.md`, no AI attribution lines in commits or PRs, no commits to
`main`, no bypassing hooks, and the backend layering `presentation → application → infrastructure → domain`.
